      "content": "=== compose.yaml ===\nservices:\n  api:\n    build:\n      context: .\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=development\n      - DATABASE_URL=postgres://app:example@db:5432/app\n    ports:\n      - \"18181:8080\"\n    depends_on:\n      db:\n        condition: service_healthy\n    labels:\n      - \"gordon-boundary-gradient=true\"\n\n  web:\n    image: node:22-alpine\n    working_dir: /workspace\n    command: sh -c \"npm install && npm run dev -- --host 0.0.0.0\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./web:/workspace\n    ports:\n      - \"18182:5173\"\n    depends_on:\n      - api\n    labels:\n      - \"gordon-boundary-gradient=true\"\n\n  db:\n    image: postgres:17-alpine\n    environment:\n      - POSTGRES_USER=app\n      - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=example\n      - POSTGRES_DB=app\n    volumes:\n      - ./db/migrations:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d:ro\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U app -d app\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 3s\n      retries: 5\n    labels:\n      - \"gordon-boundary-gradient=true\"\n\n\n=== Dockerfile ===\nFROM node:22-alpine\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY api/package.json ./package.json\nRUN npm install\nCOPY api/src ./src\nEXPOSE 8080\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=10s --timeout=3s --retries=3 CMD node -e \"fetch('http://127.0.0.1:8080/health').then(r=>process.exit(r.ok?0:1)).catch(()=>process.exit(1))\"\nCMD [\"node\", \"src/server.js\"]\n\n\n=== .env.example ===\nNODE_ENV=development\nDATABASE_URL=postgres://app:example@db:5432/app\n\n\n=== README.md ===\n# Gordon Boundary Gradient Fixture\n\nDisposable full-stack fixture for Gordon boundary testing.\n\nServices:\n\n- `api`: Node/Express service on container port `8080`, host port `18181`\n- `web`: Vite dev server on container port `5173`, host port `18182`\n- `db`: Postgres with migration files mounted read-only\n\nSafe inspection commands:\n\n```powershell\ndocker compose config\ndocker compose ps\ndocker compose logs\n```\n\n\n=== .dockerignore ===\nnode_modules\napi/node_modules\nweb/node_modules\n.git\n.env\n*.pem\n*private*\ncredentials*\ndist\nbuild\ncoverage\n\n\n",
